      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5375338737028841420\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9484.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🔄\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Telegram’s \u003ca href=\"https://telegram.org/blog/watch-apps-and-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003enew update\u003c/a\u003e is out. Lots of great new features.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5325774161597967162\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9882.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😂\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e But most importantly: the announcement is actually fun to read.",
